  "title": "Eagle Nuclear Energy Selects CBIZ CPAs P.C. as Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm",
  "summary": "RENO, NV, August 5, 2026 – Eagle Nuclear Energy Corp. (“Eagle” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: NUCL), a next-generation nuclear energy company that owns one of the largest conventional, measured and indicated uranium deposits in the United States, today announced that following a thorough evaluation process, it’s Audit Committee, with the approval of the Board of Directors has engaged CBIZ CPAs P.C. (“CBIZ CPAs”) to serve as the Company’s independent registered public accounting firm.",
